00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Not all AI use is equal. That is the finding nobody expected.

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,300
Two modes: dependent offloading and autonomous offloading.

3
00:00:06,733 --> 00:00:10,733
Both feel equal in the moment. But downstream correlates diverge sharply.

4
00:00:11,866 --> 00:00:14,866
The takeaway: you cannot trust your own judgment of whether AI is helping you.

